Z||000012||Raydar||03-05-2001||10:27 PM||||Okay... I have a new favorite Fiero to look at.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Did your car come in gold? I've never seen an 87-88 style coupe in gold.<P>BTW... Edelbrock sells a small, triangular, open-element foam air filter. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1002.jpg"> <BR>It's called a Pro-Flo 1000. 3" top to bottom.<BR>Was just about the only thing that would fit under the hood of my 350 Monza. Had a Performer manifold and a Carter AFB. Space was *tight*.  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 03-05-2001).]||||reg||1
