Z||000014||Richard Parnell||03-06-2001||01:46 PM||||Raydar- believe it or not I have that filter and it does not fit.  I heard about an even lower one in another post so will try that.  It's making me cringe every time I look at the carb uncovered like that.<BR>deceler8- my friend that worked on my car put his battery in the front and lost the use of his spare.  Until he had a flat one day.  Now he has the spare in the trunk but hates it there. He's moving his battery to the back.  There's no problem with the battery there I just keep everything fairly clean.  Only problem is my golf clubs don't fit in the trunk any more.  Oh well, I lost interest in golf after my wife decided she wanted to split.  Wonder what the connection was.  When she was there then I didn't want to be home and took up golfing.  When she leaves I start having fun at home and going out dancing---hmmm.  Anyone out there want to buy a house at Sunset Beach on the North Shore of Oahu? It's up for sale at the low low price of $380k. I'm moving to town woohooo-salsa.<BR>Sorry lost it there for a minute.  Having too much fun driving my car and going out with the salsa ladies.||||reg||1
